            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Yes. Thank you, Araji. We've never met before, but your song sounds great. Please, leave the rest to me, Nara {NICKNAME}, and Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691409"
            ]
          },
          "730691409": {
            "id": "730691409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691410"
            ]
          },
          "730691410": {
            "id": "730691410",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "If you are ready, reach out your hand and enter his dream..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7306915",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7306916",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730691601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730691601": {
            "id": "730691601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I need a minute.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691602"
            ]
          },
          "730691602": {
            "id": "730691602",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "No problem. I'll wait for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7306919",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730691901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730691901": {
            "id": "730691901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We now have the second Vasoma Fruit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691902"
            ]
          },
          "730691902": {
            "id": "730691902",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Impressive! Nara {NICKNAME} is not afraid of Marana and even drove all the monsters away. No wonder you could defeat Vanagni!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691903"
            ]
          },
          "730691903": {
            "id": "730691903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, the many adventures we've been through aren't just for show, y'know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691904"
            ]
          },
          "730691904": {
            "id": "730691904",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#That's great! Then Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon must have many memories and stories, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691907"
            ]
          },
          "730691907": {
            "id": "730691907",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#I see. If you don't mind, we'd love to hear Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon's stories sometime.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691908"
            ]
          },
          "730691908": {
            "id": "730691908",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure! We've shared our stories with others before, though it feels like so long ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691909"
            ]
          },
          "730691909": {
            "id": "730691909",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, Paimon saw a giant purple tree in the distance while we were in the Vasara Tree's dream. Paimon's pretty sure we saw it in Vanarana, too. What was that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691910"
            ]
          },
          "730691910": {
            "id": "730691910",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's the very first Ashvattha's Tree of Dreams. Hmm, how should I put this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691911"
            ]
          },
          "730691911": {
            "id": "730691911",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Dreams are like leaves in a stream. They soon float away with the water. If you want to keep a dream in place, you have to let it grow roots. That way, the dream won't drift away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730691912"
            ]
          },
          "730691912": {
            "id": "730691912",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Hmm... words are failing me..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7306920",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730692001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730692001": {
            "id": "730692001",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We got the third Vasoma Fruit! According to Araja, three Vasoma Fruits should be enough, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692002"
            ]
          },
          "730692002": {
            "id": "730692002",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Yes, that will do. Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692004"
            ]
          },
          "730692004": {
            "id": "730692004",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, you were the one helping us throughout, Arama. So why are you thanking us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692006"
            ]
          },
          "730692006": {
            "id": "730692006",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Well... It's because you are helping Arana, and Arana is my friend. So, thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692007"
            ]
          },
          "730692007": {
            "id": "730692007",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#And Nara {NICKNAME} has helped Arayasa, Aradasa, and Arasudraka find the ancient songs. They're my friends too. Thank you for that, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692008"
            ]
          },
          "730692008": {
            "id": "730692008",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Finally, I'm so happy that I got to go on adventures with Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon. So, thanks for that as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692009"
            ]
          },
          "730692009": {
            "id": "730692009",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon had a good time too! Thank you, Arama!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692010"
            ]
          },
          "730692010": {
            "id": "730692010",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "By the way, there are many signs of activity around Ashvattha's Concourses... Is there some story behind that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692011"
            ]
          },
          "730692011": {
            "id": "730692011",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's a story from long, long ago. I wasn't even a seed then. It was a time when all Nara could see Aranara and not a single Aranara was afraid of Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692012"
            ]
          },
          "730692012": {
            "id": "730692012",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Back then, Nara and Aranara helped each other. They played and sang together, just like Nara {NICKNAME} and I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692013"
            ]
          },
          "730692013": {
            "id": "730692013",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Song gatherers like Arayasa originally learned their craft from Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692014"
            ]
          },
          "730692014": {
            "id": "730692014",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Ashvattha's Concourses used to be where Nara and Aranara played together. But that was a long time ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692015"
            ]
          },
          "730692015": {
            "id": "730692015",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "After the horrible, horrible catastrophe occurred, Vanarana was devastated, and the concourses were left desolate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692016"
            ]
          },
          "730692016": {
            "id": "730692016",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's what happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692017"
            ]
          },
          "730692017": {
            "id": "730692017",
            "speakerId": 20646,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes, and it's a very scary tale indeed. I'm lucky that they are not memories to me — only stories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730692018"
            ]
          },
          "730692018": {
            "id": "730692018",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Don't worry! Things will get better. Right, {NICKNAME}?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
